OL,3,GNEWSAOld hall to be lit as part of
OL,4,Ahistory celebration
OL,5,
OL,6,FA town's historic landmark is set to be
OL,7,Filluminated as part of a plan to
OL,8,Fcelebrate the area's local heritage.
OL,10,FCumberland Council said it would
OL,11,Finstall ground-mounted lights around
OL,12,Fthe Grade I-listed Workington Hall.
OL,14,FThe building is the former home of the
OL,15,FCurwens, Lords of the Manor of
OL,16,FWorkington, who sheltered Mary Queen of
OL,17,FScots at the hall in 1568 before her
OL,18,Fcapture and execution.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
