OL,3,GNEWSAOld hall to be lit as part of
OL,4,Ahistory celebration
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council said the ruin would be
OL,7,Filluminated until 22:30 in the colder
OL,8,Fmonths only, with lighting focused on
OL,9,Fthe hall to minimise impact on bats and
OL,10,Fother wildlife.
